OL,3,GNEWSAGo-ahead for go-kart plans at old
OL,4,Adepartment store
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an indoor karting centre
OL,7,Finside an empty city centre department
OL,8,Fstore have been approved.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council green-lit
OL,11,Fproposals from Team Sport to develop
OL,12,Fgo-karting tracks, bowling lanes, an
OL,13,Farcade and restaurant areas at the
OL,14,Fformer Debenhams store, which shut in
OL,15,FMay 2021.
OL,17,FThose behind the scheme added the
OL,18,Fdevelopment would create about 40 full
OL,19,Ftime equivalent jobs.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
