OL,3,GNEWSAGo-ahead for go-kart plans at old
OL,4,Adepartment store
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil planners said the potential
OL,7,Fnoise from go-karting across the
OL,8,Fbuilding's upper floors was not likely
OL,9,Fto generate an "unacceptable adverse
OL,10,Fimpact". Under planning conditions, the
OL,11,Fdevelopment must be started within
OL,12,Fthree years.
